REPLACE_ME: This is a placeholder for `favicon.ico`.
Please generate a multi-resolution ICO from the PNG (or SVG) locally:

Using ImageMagick locally (after generating PNG):

convert assets/img/favicons/favicon-96x96.png -define icon:auto-resize=64,48,32,16 assets/img/favicons/favicon.ico

Then commit the generated file to replace this placeholder.
